Package: sqlqueries
Title: Programmatic SQL Query Construction
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Jakub", "Bujnowicz", , "bujnowiczgithub@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A functional framework for composing SQL statements from
    R expressions using an S3 class hierarchy and non-standard evaluation.
